{"number":1,"sceneNumber":1,"heading":{"raw":"EXT. INDUSTRIAL DISTRICT - DAY","intExt":"EXT","location":"INDUSTRIAL DISTRICT","timeOfDay":"DAY"},"context":{"set":"EXT. INDUSTRIAL DISTRICT - DAY","lighting":"direct sunlight, low-key, dramatic shadows, overhead sun, daylight balanced (5600K)","timeOfDay":"DAY","atmosphere":"ominous","weather":"rain"},"characters":[{"name":"NARRATOR","position":"not visible","appearance":"","wardrobe":"The NARRATOR's attire is as elusive as their presence, often described as a flowing cloak that seems to merge with the shadows. The fabric is a deep, rich black, absorbing light and adding to the aura of mystery. Subtle details, like intricate embroidery along the edges, catch the eye momentarily before fading into the darkness. The cloak's hood is often drawn, further concealing their identity, and the material moves with a fluid grace, echoing the NARRATOR's ethereal nature.","physicalAppearance":"The NARRATOR is an enigmatic figure, whose presence is felt more than seen. Their voice carries a weight of wisdom and experience, suggesting an age that transcends time. Though rarely visible, when glimpsed, they appear as a silhouette against the backdrop of the scene, with a tall, slender frame. Their face is often obscured, but hints of sharp features and deep-set eyes can be discerned, lending an air of mystery and authority.","emotion":"The NARRATOR's tone is calm and measured, conveying a sense of foreboding and gravitas as they describe the unfolding scene.","action":null}],"set":"EXT. INDUSTRIAL DISTRICT - DAY","description":"The industrial area sprawls across the landscape, a labyrinth of rusted metal and concrete structures that loom ominously under the oppressive sky. The buildings are a patchwork of corrugated iron and weathered brick, their surfaces pockmarked by years of exposure to the elements. Pipes and conduits snake along the walls, dripping with rainwater that cascades down in rivulets. The ground is a slick expanse of puddles and oil stains, reflecting the intermittent flashes of lightning that illuminate the scene with stark, momentary brilliance. The air is thick with the scent of wet metal and the distant hum of machinery, creating an atmosphere of tension and unease. Shadows stretch and shift with each lightning strike, adding to the sense of foreboding that permeates the area.","actions":"No specific actions in this shot","dialogue":"NARRATOR\nIn the heart of the industrial district, a storm brews, threatening the livelihood of property owners.","blocking":"Characters maintain their positions","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: Lightning flashes across the sky.. SOUND EFFECT: Rain begins to pour heavily.","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: medium. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"medium","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":9.4,"formatted":"0:09"},"characterCount":{"count":1170,"limit":1170,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
