{"number":"3a","sceneNumber":2,"heading":{"raw":"INT. WAREHOUSE - DAY","intExt":"INT","location":"WAREHOUSE","timeOfDay":"DAY"},"context":{"set":"INT. WAREHOUSE - DAY","lighting":"natural window light, bright, even illumination, from windows, daylight balanced (5600K)","timeOfDay":"DAY","atmosphere":"tense","weather":null},"characters":[{"name":"EMPLOYEES","position":"in scene","appearance":"","wardrobe":"The EMPLOYEES' clothing is practical and suited for manual labor. Overalls, t-shirts, and sturdy boots are common among them. Some wear caps or bandanas to keep their hair out of the way, and their clothes are slightly worn, indicating regular use in a demanding environment.","physicalAppearance":"The EMPLOYEES are a diverse group, varying in age and appearance. They are dressed in work attire, with some wearing overalls and others in casual shirts and jeans. Their expressions are focused and determined as they work quickly to protect the goods from water damage.","emotion":null,"action":null},{"name":"ALEX","position":"in scene","appearance":"","wardrobe":"ALEX is dressed in a practical yet stylish manner, wearing a tailored navy blue blazer over a crisp white shirt. His trousers are dark and well-fitted, and he wears polished brown leather shoes. ALEX's attire is completed with a simple silver watch on his wrist, adding a touch of elegance to his otherwise utilitarian look.","physicalAppearance":"ALEX is a middle-aged man with a rugged yet refined appearance. His face is etched with lines of experience, and his eyes carry a hint of worry. His build is solid, suggesting a life of hard work, and his hair, peppered with gray, is neatly combed back. ALEX's demeanor is one of authority tempered by the weight of responsibility.","emotion":"worried","action":null}],"set":"INT. WAREHOUSE - DAY","description":"The scene unfolds in a dimly lit warehouse, where the air is thick with the scent of dampness and metal. The ceiling looms high above, its surface marred by water stains and the occasional drip that echoes through the space. Rows of valuable machinery and stacks of goods are arranged in a haphazard manner, their metallic surfaces glistening under the sparse overhead lights. The atmosphere is tense, with shadows cast by the flickering bulbs creating an eerie dance across the concrete floor. The walls are lined with shelves, cluttered with tools and equipment, while the distant hum of machinery adds a constant, low undertone to the scene. The mood is one of urgency and concern, as the threat of water damage looms over the valuable assets.","actions":"rush to cover items","dialogue":"No dialogue in this shot","blocking":"ALEX: stands stands surveying the damage (center stage)\nEMPLOYEES: rush to cover items (various positions across the stage)","sfx":"SOUND EFFECT: Water drips from the ceiling","techDetails":"Shot Type: establishing. Camera Movement: static. Framing: medium-shot. Visual Style: Reality","metadata":{"shotType":"establishing","cameraMovement":"static","framing":"medium-shot","visualStyle":"Reality","cinematicStyle":null,"technicalNotes":[]},"duration":{"seconds":6,"formatted":"0:06"},"characterCount":{"count":1067,"limit":1067,"percentage":100},"warnings":[]}
